 "interpretation": {
  "summary": "Sky platform complex: a round central hub with 8 arms (bridges / ramps) to outer decks and octagon bastions, floating high above a sea with rocky islands, waterfalls and a cloud layer; sunset sky with a planet, spire city, ring megastructure.",
  "scale_basis": "top-down panel: hub diameter 390 px (2x crop) ~ 47 m (crates ~1.5 m in the perspective views); 0.12 m per 2x-crop pixel",
  "visible": [
   "round hub with concentric red target marking",
   "8 arms: N hall, small NE turret, NW bastion, W post, SW octagon, S gate + S tower, SE octagon, E deck",
   "bridges with red railings",
   "tall towers with red banners",
   "crates as cover on the hub",
   "sea far below with rocky islands, green tops",
   "waterfalls off cliffs",
   "cloud layer under the decks",
   "sunset sky, planet, spire city, ring megastructure, distant mountains"
  ],
  "inferred": [
   "deck heights (hub 40 m above the sea, bastions 3 m lower, turret 3 m higher)",
   "massive pylons under every deck down to the sea bed",
   "exact island and cliff positions outside the top-down crop",
   "invisible colliders round the complex above the void",
   "fall below 25 m = respawn"
  ],
  "assumptions": [
   "mode: structured deck complex inside an open world whose terrain is scenery only (terrain_playable false)",
   "covered deck (panel 5) approximated by halls / towers - no interiors in the module library"
  ],
  "questions": []
